## SQ-PTH-15b | scratch kubejs data tag exempt + snowball, /reload: snowball flies through the cube; carts from 2.5 blocks before the web (empty carts lose 4 % a tick on rails), control lane without web
> fill 1010 -60 1179 1012 -58 1181 minecraft:cobweb
shell mkdir -p kubejs/data/creativecompat/tags/entity_types/passthrough/projectile && printf '{"replace":false,"values":["minecraft:snowball"]}' > kubejs/data/creativecompat/tags/entity_types/passthrough/projectile/exempt.json
> reload
sleep 25
> summon minecraft:snowball 1004.5 -58.5 1180.5 {NoGravity:1b,Tags:["m15b"]}
> execute as @e[tag=m15b] if entity @s[type=#creativecompat:passthrough_exempt/all] run say PTH15b-snowball-exempt
> zpth watch m15b 45 1
> zpth launch m15b none 1.5 0 0
sleep 3
> fill 1000 -60 1192 1024 -60 1192 minecraft:rail[shape=east_west]
> summon minecraft:minecart 1009.5 -60 1190.5 {Tags:["c15b"]}
> summon minecraft:minecart 1009.5 -60 1192.5 {Tags:["c15c"]}
> zpth watch c15b 100 2
> zpth watch c15c 100 2
> zpth motion c15b 0.4 0 0
> zpth motion c15c 0.4 0 0
sleep 6
shell rm -f kubejs/data/creativecompat/tags/entity_types/passthrough/projectile/exempt.json
> reload
sleep 25
expect PTH15b-snowball-exempt$
look m15b passes x 1013 at mot x about 1.4; c15b slowed under the web (x 1011.5..1013) but not stopped dead, compared with c15c

